+
+# Tostr
+
+Finally, a toaster that listens. <!-- fact:product-tagline -->
+
+Tostr is the first smart toaster: a toaster you can talk to and program. <!-- fact:product-claim-first -->
+
+## Price
+
+| Item | Price |
+|---|---|
+| Tostr (device) | $129 <!-- fact:device-price --> |
+
+## Hardware
+
+| Spec | Value |
+|---|---|
+| Browning levels | 7, from 1 (warm bread) to 7 (charcoal) <!-- fact:browning-levels --> |
+| Slots | 2 extra-wide slots <!-- fact:slots --> |
+| Cycle time | 90 seconds for a full cycle at level 4 <!-- fact:cycle-seconds --> |
+| Warranty | 2-year warranty <!-- fact:warranty-years --> |
+
+## Personalities
+
+Wake it with "Hey Tostr" and it answers in the voice the customer picks. <!-- fact:wake-word -->
+Tostr ships with 3 personalities: <!-- fact:personalities-count -->
+
+| Personality | Character |
+|---|---|
+| Butler | Polite and brief. Calls you "sir or madam" until told otherwise. Included on Free. <!-- fact:personality-butler --> |
+| Coach | Motivational. Counts your slices and says "one more rep" when you ask for seconds. <!-- fact:personality-coach --> |
+| Gremlin | Sarcastic. Comments on your bread choices and occasionally toasts one side darker on purpose. <!-- fact:personality-gremlin --> |
+
+## Plans
+
+The toaster is hardware. The app and API have a free tier and a paid tier.
+
+| Plan | Price and what it includes |
+|---|---|
+| Free | $0 per month: Butler personality, manual toasting, API read access <!-- fact:plan-free-price --> |
+| Personality Pack <!-- fact:plan-pro-name --> | $4.99 per month: all personalities, Bagel mode, full API access <!-- fact:plan-pro-price --> |
+
+## Warranty
+
+Every Tostr comes with a 2-year warranty. <!-- fact:warranty-years -->
